## Syntax highlighting for the Shakespeare Programming Language.

syntax shakespeare "\.spl$"
comment ""

# Later rules paint over earlier ones.
color yellow "\<[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]*\>"
color brightgreen "[+-]?\<[0-9]+"
icolor magenta "\<(Speak[[:space:]]+your[[:space:]]+mind|Open[[:space:]]+your[[:space:]]+heart|Let[[:space:]]+us|You[[:space:]]+are|I[[:space:]]+am|Are[[:space:]]+you|Am[[:space:]]+I|Recall|Remember|If|Let|As|Thou|The|First|Second|Third|Fourth|Fifth|Sixth|Seventh|You|I|We|they)\>"
icolor brightblue "\<(Act|Scene|Enter|Exit|Exeunt)\>"
color green "\[[^]]*(\]|$)"
